      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4mt",
          "text": "Dating apps have changed the way people connect. With a swipe or a message, platforms like Hinge and Tinder promise meaningful relationships, convenience, and compatibility. While these platforms can lead to meaningful relationships, they also come with serious and overlooked risks.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "i4mv",
      "src": "./images/2025-12-shutterstock_2459252425-1.jpg",
      "alt": "Law Firms Sue Hinge and Match Group After Felon Assaults Multiple Users On Its Platform"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4mx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4mw",
          "text": "Harassment, coercion, stalking, and sexual violence are not rare experiences in the digital dating world. It is a common occurrence that demands greater attention, accountability, and user protection.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4mz",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4my",
          "text": "A Growing Digital Risk",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4n1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4n0",
          "text": "Online dating platforms create special vulnerabilities. Unlike traditional dating, users often meet strangers with limited background information, potentially relying on misleading profiles or worse. This can expose the user to harmful behavior and makes it difficult to safely identify warning signs early.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4n8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l4n5",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37036157/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4n2",
          "text": "Research shows that",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4n3",
          "text": " 57-88.8% ",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4n4",
          "text": "of users have experienced some form of harassment on dating apps (",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4n6",
          "text": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37036157/",
          "marks": [
            "l4n5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4n7",
          "text": "). A majority of users report experiencing unwanted sexual messages, persistent contact after rejection, or aggressive behavior. For some, these interactions escalate into unsafe, real-world encounters.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4na",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4n9",
          "text": "When Platform Failures Have Consequences",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4nt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l4ne",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gDrW5ZVm3vcjoXyO_h6bxuAEjtP_CzDo/view?usp=sharing"
        },
        {
