        },
        {
          "_key": "l4nq",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.denver7.com/news/crime/after-denver-cardiologists-conviction-of-drugging-raping-women-several-victims-file-lawsuit-against-hinge"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nb",
          "text": "In Denver, Colorado, a coalition of law firms, including ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nc",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nd",
          "text": ", have filed a ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nf",
          "text": "lawsuit",
          "marks": [
            "l4ne"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4ng",
          "text": " against Hinge and its parent company, Match Group, on behalf of women targeted by convicted serial rapist ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4ni",
          "text": "Dr. Stephen Matthews.",
          "marks": [
            "l4nh"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nj",
          "text": " The 54-page complaint, filed in the Denver District Court, has already gained a lot of attention by media outlets such as ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nl",
          "text": "The Guardian",
          "marks": [
            "l4nk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nm",
          "text": ", ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4no",
          "text": "CBS News",
          "marks": [
            "l4nn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4np",
          "text": ", and ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nr",
          "text": "Denver 7 News",
          "marks": [
            "l4nq"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4ns",
          "text": ".",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4nx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l4nu",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://spotoncolorado.com/denver-area/2201287/six-women-sue-hinge-ex-denver-cardiologist.html"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nv",
          "text": "Stephen Matthews",
          "marks": [
            "l4nu"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4nw",
          "text": " was a former cardiologist who allegedly used Hinge and Tinder to lure women into his home before drugging, raping, and gaslighting them. According to the lawsuit, Match Group and Hinge were warned as early as September 2020 that Matthews was using the platform to assault women. Hinge acknowledged receiving this report and claimed Matthews had been banned, but those assurances were false.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4nz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4ny",
          "text": "Rather than removing him, Hinge continued to promote Matthews as a match, recommending women to him, and him to women, for the next three years. “Every detail in this complaint shows a catastrophic failure of basic safety…Hinge promised it had banned him. Then, Hinge recommended him to more women,” said Carrie Goldberg, Founder of C.A. Goldberg, a firm involved in this lawsuit.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4o1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4o0",
          "text": "In 2024, Matthews was convicted of 35 criminal counts related to drugging and sexually assaulting at least 11 women he met on dating apps, leading to a sentence of 158 years in prison.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4o3",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4o2",
          "text": "The Emotional Impact",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4o5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4o4",
          "text": "Experiences of harassment or assault connected to dating apps can be a very traumatic experience for many. “I thought I was safe. I thought he was who he said he was. I woke up in a nightmare. I woke up with injuries I will never forget,” said Alexa, a survivor that interacted with Matthews.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4o7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4o6",
          "text": "Some other lasting effects of this type of harassment can include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4o9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4o8",
          "text": "Anxiety and fear when meeting new people",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4ob",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4oa",
          "text": "Loss of trust in others",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4od",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4oc",
          "text": "Depression or isolation",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4of",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4oe",
          "text": "Trauma responses such as hypervigilance or shame",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4oh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4og",
          "text": "These impacts are valid and deserve attention and care.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4oj",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4oi",
          "text": "Staying Safer While Using Dating Apps",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4ol",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4ok",
          "text": "Raising awareness for safer-dating practices is very important. Some of which include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4on",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4om",
          "text": "Meeting in public places and sharing plans with a trusted person",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4op",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4oo",
          "text": "Taking time to get to know someone before meeting in person",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4or",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4oq",
          "text": "Trusting your instincts and leaving situations that feel uncomfortable",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4ot",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4os",
          "text": "Using in-app safety tools, blocking, and reporting features",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4ov",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4ou",
          "text": "At the same time, dating platforms, such as Hinge and Tinder, must be held accountable for enforcing safety measures and responding promptly to reports of abuse. Dan Gerash, an attorney at Gerash Steiner, P.C stated that, “Hinge had the data, the signals, and the responsibility to intervene. Hinge failed. Our lawsuit is designed to force change on a company that should have acted long before these women were harmed.”",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4ox",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4ow",
          "text": "You’re Not Alone",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4oz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4oy",
          "text": "For many people, dating apps are a normal way to connect. However, acknowledging their risks is essential. If you or someone you know has experienced sexual harassment or violence connected to online dating, help is available. Support organizations offer guidance, emotional support, and resources for healing.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b4p1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4p0",
          "text": "Dating apps are a modern reality, but awareness, education, and support can help make digital dating safer for everyone.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
